@startuml game-state
!pragma layout smetana
title 你画我猜 · 会话状态机（V1 = classic，V2 = relay）

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F7FB
  BorderColor #4A5A8A
  ArrowColor #4A5A8A
}

[*] --> Lobby

Lobby --> Preparing : game.start / 洗牌排座、抽词
Preparing --> Playing : 首位画手确定 / page.add(roundId)

state Playing {
  [*] --> Drawing

  Drawing --> Guessing : [classic] turn.commit / round.timeout
  Drawing --> Handoff : [relay] turn.commit 且还有下一位
  Handoff --> Drawing : handoff.ready / 切换 drawerId
  Drawing --> Guessing : [relay] turn.commit 且已是最后一位

  Guessing --> [*] : round.allGuessed / round.timeout
}

Playing --> Reveal : 本轮结束
Reveal --> Scoring : 展示完成 / 计分
Scoring --> Playing : round < rounds / 新一轮 page.add
Scoring --> Finished : round = rounds / 落库 wb_game_session

Playing --> Paused : player.disconnect (drawer)
Paused --> Playing : player.reconnect (≤ 30s)
Paused --> Finished : 超时 > 30s

Finished --> Lobby : owner 返回房间
Lobby --> [*] : 房间解散

note right of Playing
  Playing.Drawing 期间：
  仅 drawerId 可写当前轮页，
  canWrite() 由 BoardPlugin 判定。
end note

note bottom of Paused
  倒计时冻结；重连后恢复剩余时间。
  猜词者断线不影响状态机。
end note

@enduml
